              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+homotopy+equivalence"} weak homotopy equivalence
              – reflecting the fact that non-compactness of the Riemann surfaces and absence of any asymptotic boundary condition provides a large supply of holomorphic functions.
          %p In fact:
          %p
